{"slug":"joshikousei-no-mudazukai","anilist":105081,"ad":"Joshikousei no Mudazukai","adEn":"Wasteful Days of High School Girls","yil":2019,"puan":74,"format":"TV","durum":"FINISHED","sezon":"SUMMER","sure":24,"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1343/111356.jpg","p2":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx105081-pc4jgCmAP0dZ.jpg","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/105081-9EnxVsn9iNq9.jpg","banner4k":null,"banner4kGenislik":null,"bannerTmdb":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Av0ddR5u6xkJQQgzHR3kGHIuT6m.jpg","bannerTmdbGenislik":1920,"ozet":"Tanaka Nozomu isn’t exactly brilliant. But, given that her only goal for high school was to get a boyfriend, who else would fail to realize that attending an all-girls school was a bad idea? Well, there’s always the fallback plan of getting other girls to introduce her to boys they know.\n\nToo bad that Tanaka’s “bright” idea of giving her classmates nicknames based on less attractive character traits has caused her un-flattered friends “Robo” (for her apparent lack of emotions) and “Wota” (a reference to a creepy otaku types), as well as not-friends like “Loli” (who’s hypersensitive about her petite size,) to “reward” Tanaka with the special nickname of “Baka” (“idiot”), which is quickly adopted by the entire student body. Well, maybe the second week of school will be better.\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","turler":["Komedi","Günlük Yaşam","Okul","Kadın Başrol"],"iliski":[],"seri":null,"fragman":{"site":"youtube","id":"mx_aGPftB-o"},"yasal":[{"a":"HIDIVE","u":"https://www.hidive.com/tv/wasteful-days-of-high-school-girls"},{"a":"YouTube","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLwLSw1_eDZl3a6WBPlpPJlaNKNGwHGA08"},{"a":"Netflix","u":"https://www.netflix.com/title/81256684"}],"kaynakSayisi":65,"bolumSayisi":12,"bolumler":[{"n":1,"no":"1","ad":"1. Bölüm","slug":"joshikousei-no-mudazukai-1-bolum","ks":12,"ekip":[{"g":"AMT","e":"Zekken / Kusogaki / Bakayalo /